            <p>The invoice stays linked to the buyer and PO, with a quick preview in PunchOut Central.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pc-order-step__state">
            <span class="pc-order-step__state-dot"></span>
            <span class="pc-order-step__state-text">Waiting</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="pc-order-process__close">
        <div>
          <strong>Six steps. One connected order.</strong>
          <span>PunchOut Central handles the technical flow so you can focus on the customer.</span>
        </div>
